# Plugin: Using Git Worktrees

Purpose:
  Adapt git worktrees skill for SDDRA C1 arm.

Owns: plugins\plugin-adapters\using-git-worktrees.sdd
Adaptation:
  Context isolation instead of git worktrees:
    - AI works in .sdd/ context
    - Human works in project/ context
    - No direct code access until S1 approval

  Branch strategy:
    feature/*, bugfix/*, hotfix/* linked to task ID

Usage:
  Chain: C1 (code arm)
  Trigger: S1 arm approved, code generation needed

State: +
